synopsis: "Embeddable MIT-licensed agent framework for OCaml"
description: """
Native OCaml Core for PRAXO-CORE: JSON, tool calls, JSON Schema subset,
plugin manifests, policy hooks, memory, checkpoints, context compaction,
middleware, events, OTel, retriever, synchronous delegation, MCP client
boundary, and an agent loop. No Go runtime or provider adapter is required.
The public module is Praxo_core; OCaml module names cannot contain a hyphen.
"""
